  Configuration or stage                             Time (s)
  ------------------------------------------------ ----------
  PyMatching decoder                                 0.000043
  Correlated BP+OSD decoder                            0.0050
  MPS, χ = 16                                           0.540
  MPS, χ = 32                                           3.269
  SB search, 8 × 100                                    0.104
